  triage:closedBy "quality-mgr" ;
  triage:closureNote "Literal-string forbidden-mention check replaced by contains_adapter_availability_inference, a token-window scan over code (comment/whitespace-stripped) that matches wrapper terms near option-branch terms; its own test adapter_availability_guard_scans_code_branches_not_comment_wording proves comment-only rewording no longer defeats the guard. Fixed in commit 0445e8a79." ;
